  "description": "The dress-rehearsal harness (roadmap Phase 5): entrant strategies, the pool-cycle orchestrator, and an OFFLINE 20-pool rehearsal that runs in CI over a FakeChain. The credentialed devnet run is the daemon over Web3Chain and is driven by docs/guide/DEVNET-REHEARSAL.md, not from here.",
